# adder4.stim : every pair (A, B), a new pair every 40 ns: each input bit is a clock with twice the
# period of the bit below it, so A3 A2 A1 A0 counts 0..15 and B counts once per 16 values of A
set CIN 0 @0
clock A0 period 80 high 40 start 40
clock A1 period 160 high 80 start 80
clock A2 period 320 high 160 start 160
clock A3 period 640 high 320 start 320
clock B0 period 1280 high 640 start 640
clock B1 period 2560 high 1280 start 1280
clock B2 period 5120 high 2560 start 2560
clock B3 period 10240 high 5120 start 5120
end 10240
